utritional needs of the aging population.", "ENVEJECIMIENTO SALUDABLE EN TOLEDO:A longitudinal study focused on healthy aging in Toledo, Spain, contributing to research on frailty.", "ESTUDIO FRADEA:ESTUDIO FRADEA is a research study focused on investigating aspects of fragility among the elderly. It aims to enhance the understanding of aging by analyzing frailty in this demographic, including its prevalence and impact. Through its comprehensive approach, ESTUDIO FRADEA contributes valuable insights into the challenges faced by older adults, thereby advancing knowledge in the field of gerontology."], "parameters": {"model": "text-embedding-3-small", "temperature": 0.0, "frequency_penalty": null, "presence_penalty": null, "top_p": 1.0, "max_tokens": 4000, "n": 1}, "history": null}